---
title: Deposits - Vintage Story Wiki
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{{ lang }}/deposits/index.html"
---
{% import "macros/datatable.njk" as dt %}
<h1>Deposits</h1>
<p class="muted">
  Where ore/gem/rock deposits naturally occur, read directly from the game's worldgen rules.
</p>
<p class="muted">
  "Depth" and the host-rock list below are the raw worldgen rule the game checks, not a guarantee
  -- a "near surface" deposit can still occasionally be found deeper, and these are the conditions
  a <em>chunk</em> must meet, not a promise any single spot within it generates something.
</p>
<p class="muted">Source: <code>worldgen/deposits/**/*.json</code>.</p>

<h2>How rock type is determined</h2>
<p class="muted">
  Deposits above describe what occurs <em>inside</em> a given rock type -- not how that base rock
  type itself ends up at a given spot. That's a separate worldgen rule
  (<code>worldgen/rockstrata.json</code>): each rock type is placed by its own layered noise
  function, compared against a per-rock threshold, not a simple depth band, climate rule, or
  fixed global ordering. <code>genDir</code> says which direction that rock's layer fills from.
</p>
{% call dt.datatable(40, "Search rock types...", ["Rock", "Group", "Fill direction", "Mod"]) %}
{% for rs in generated.rockStrata | sort(false, false, "blockCode") %}
  <tr data-search="{{ rs.blockCode }}" data-category="{{ rs.rockGroup }}" data-mod="{{ rs.sourceMod }}" data-mod-label="{{ generated.mods | modName(rs.sourceMod) }}">
    <td><a href="{{ ('/' ~ lang ~ '/') | url }}items/{{ rs.domain }}/{{ rs.blockCode | slugify }}/">{{ generated.items | displayName(rs.domain, rs.blockCode) }}</a></td>
    <td>{% if rs.rockGroup %}<span class="tag">{{ rs.rockGroup }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if rs.genDir == "BottomUp" %}Bottom-up (near bedrock){% elif rs.genDir == "TopDown" %}Top-down (near surface){% endif %}</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ rs.sourceMod }}</span></td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}

<h2>Ore / gem / rock deposits ({{ generated.deposits.length }})</h2>
{% call dt.datatable(40, "Search deposits...", ["Deposit", "Category", "Host rock(s)", "Depth", "Mod"]) %}
{% for dep in generated.deposits | sort(false, false, "code") %}
  <tr data-search="{{ dep.hostRocks | join(' ') }}" data-category="{{ dep.category }}" data-mod="{{ dep.sourceMod }}" data-mod-label="{{ generated.mods | modName(dep.sourceMod) }}">
    <td>{{ dep.code }}</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ dep.category }}</span></td>
    <td>
      {% if dep.gradesByRock %}
        {% for rock, grades in dep.gradesByRock %}{{ rock }} ({{ grades | join(", ") }}){% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {{ dep.hostRocks | join(", ") }}
      {% endif %}
    </td>
    <td>
      {% if dep.yPosRel %}
        {% set y = dep.yPosRel.avg %}
        {% if y >= 0.8 %}near surface{% elif y >= 0.5 %}shallow{% elif y >= 0.25 %}moderate{% else %}deep{% endif %}
      {% endif %}
    </td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ dep.sourceMod }}</span></td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}
